{"The GrafanaRuleListItem component rendered inside the rules.map() callback is missing the key prop. The key variable is destructured from ruleWithOrigin on line 152 and is correctly used in the datasource and default cases, but not in the grafana case. This causes React reconciliation issues and can lead to incorrect component state when the list updates.": 0.8708063364028931, "When GrafanaRuleListItem renders RuleActionsButtons with only promRule (no rule), the silence menu item can appear based on useGrafanaPromRuleAbilities returning [true, true]. However, the SilenceGrafanaRuleDrawer only renders when rulerRuleType.grafana.alertingRule(rule) is true. Since rule is undefined, clicking the silence menu item sets showSilenceDrawer to true but the drawer never renders, resulting in a non-functional button.": 0.9354615211486816}